omaania
Copyright 2026 rob-d3v

Unofficial community plugin, not affiliated with Omarchy or 37signals.

omaania does not bundle Ania Player. `omaania setup` downloads the official
AniaPlayerSetup.deb from the latest GitHub release of rob-d3v/ania-player,
checks its sha256 against the release's SHA256SUMS.txt, and unpacks it into
your home folder. Ania Player is distributed under its own licence terms,
shipped inside that package.

The "Hey Omarchy" wake word bundle is shared with the omahey plugin
(Apache-2.0) and uses the openWakeWord front-end models (Apache-2.0,
David Scripka) and Silero VAD (MIT, Silero Team).

The optional `ania-mcp` npm package (MIT) is run with npx only after you
agree to it during setup.
